sentences.text:
This writ petition is filed for following reliefs:
a) Issue a Writ in the nature of Certiorari of General Award bearing no.KIADB/LAQ- 2/1475/2022-23 dated 13.07.2022 passed by respondent no.3 as per Annexure-A;
b) Issue Writ in the nature of Mandamus directing Respondents to consider the case of Petitioners as per Section 29(2) of the KIAD, ct, for passing the consent award in respect of petitioners land etc..
